             \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $A=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        $-16$                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$\\,B=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        $0$                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$\\,C=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        $2$\n\nEarlier part 9:\n\n$\\int \\frac{-16t}{2{t}^{2}+3}\\,\\text{d}t=\\,$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        $-4\\ln(2t^2+3)$                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$+\\,K.$\n\nCurrent part:\n\n$\\int {y}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\operatorname{ln}⁡($\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$)+\\,K,$\nwhere $K$ is an arbitrary constant." 13194139535313 true] [17592186343264 1113 #uuid "5eeeaf73-5eae-5c4f-8c30-fb9e55938f4c" 13194139535313 true] [17592186343264 1145 "In part 9, we found that\n\n$$\n-16\\int \\frac{t}{2{t}^{2}+3}\\,\\text{d}t=-4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2{t}^{2}+3)+K.\n$$\n\nUsing the sum and constant multiple rules, we compute the sum of the integrals of each function in the partial sum decomposition of ${y}^{′}(t)$ found in part 8:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {y}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int (\\frac{2}{t}-\\frac{16t}{2{t}^{2}+3})\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{2}{t}\\,\\text{d}t-16\\int \\frac{t}{2{t}^{2}+3}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|-4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2{t}^{2}+3)+K \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡{t}^{2}-\\operatorname{ln}⁡((2{t}^{2}+3)^{4})+K \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{t}^{2}}{(2{t}^{2}+3)^{4}})+K.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535313 true] [17592186343265 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343266 13194139535313 true] [17592186343265 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535313 true] [17592186343265 1041 "field-1" 13194139535313 true] [17592186343265 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343266 13194139535313 true] [17592186343265 1110 #uuid "5c7f7fb0-6124-585d-b7ee-b3e18382e87f" 13194139535313 true] [17592186343266 1034 "\\frac{t^2}{(2t^2+3)^4}" 13194139535313 true] [17592186343266 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535313 true] [17592186343266 1111 #uuid "f166218b-accf-568b-a67c-c09a8b2d0abc" 13194139535313 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-132974" 17592186343233 "q-132974/field-1" 17592186343234 "q-132974/field-1/aa93311fc539c7248ba7da72d76da24598eaaa2420ce8a4f44747c211af68486" 1759218